---
import { siteConfig } from "../config";
---

<section id="beyond-code" class="p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 lg:p-24">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-start">
    <div class="lg:col-span-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl xl:text-7xl font-bold text-white">
        Beyond Code
      </h2>
      <div
        class="w-[75px] h-[5px] mt-2 rounded-full"
        style={`background-color: ${siteConfig.accentColor}`}
      ></div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-8">
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl md:text-2xl leading-relaxed text-slate-300">
        When I'm not building software, I play guitar, sing, perform at cafes,
        and train in the gym. Music gives me another way to experiment, create,
        and connect with people, while strength training keeps me disciplined
        and focused on steady progress—qualities I bring into the products I
        build as well.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
